<title>USA: Consolidated Stores sets 5-for-4 split.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Stores sets 5-for-4 split.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Stores Corp said Tuesday that its board has authorized a five-for-four split of its common stock, to be effected through the distribution of additional shares.</p>
<p>The shares will be distributed December 24 to stockholders of record December 10, the company said.</p>
<p>Consolidated Stores is a toys and close-out merchandise retailer with 1,981 stores in 50 states and Puerto Rico.</p>
</text>
